WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.120
Hi, my name is Rebecca, I'm 43 years of age, and I have been with Blueprint since May last year,

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:12.800
suffered with mobility issues for a number of years, that progressively got worse and worse,

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:17.120
to the point where I needed help to get out of bed, I couldn't stand up properly,

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:23.440
I fell over a lot. When I finally got diagnosed, such as last year, I had the diagnosis of

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:28.720
young onset Parkinson's and also dystonia, which makes my certain parts of my body

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:34.160
and sees up. The first thing was getting the hang of the medication. The second thing,

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:39.440
and also the most important thing, was for me to get moving again. So I joined Blueprint,

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:46.480
and from being a person who needed physical help to even get out of the bed in the morning,

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:51.440
I now have come down, I've done my barbell class today with no medicine in my body,

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:58.240
I've been able to walk, I can feel the benefits of coming here. My muscles are working in a much

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:01.840
special way, they're supporting me, I don't fall half as much as I did before.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:07.120
If somebody like me can come down to a place like this, where you're surrounded by not only

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:14.720
coaches that give you unbelievable support and advice, but also a community where people are

00:01:14.720 --> 00:01:19.600
patting you on the back and telling you that you're amazing. In regardless of your situation,

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.880
I see you go, give it a go guys.

